rt on orphan durable queues and backlog growth."},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#events-are-not-arriving","content":"A consumer outage does not always prevent the main operation from completing. That is why you must monitor RabbitMQ and independently verify the persistence of audit logs."},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"The chart can enable OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Traces are exported over OTLP HTTP and logs can be directed to a compatible endpoint, such as VictoriaLogs. Use a correlation identifier and the same time window to join Gateway, authz, service and dependency."},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"Before closing an incident, record:"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the confirmed cause;"},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#observability","content":"the time scope and affected resources;"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/deployment/troubleshooting#observabil