-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"genera `lamassu.yaml` e instala el chart de Lamassu"},"179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"carga datos de ejemplo opcionalmente"},"180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"La configuración generada expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del mismo Gateway y provisiona al usuario inicial `lamassu` como superadministrador de Lamassu."},"181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Al proporcionar `--tls-crt` y `--tls-key`, Fastlane crea el Secret `downstream-provided-crt` y configura `tls.type: external`."},"182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-previ