leshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"inspecciona dead-letter queues;"},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"alerta sobre colas durables huérfanas y crecimiento de backlog."},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Una caída del consumidor no siempre impide que la operación principal termine. Por eso debes monitorizar RabbitMQ y verificar de forma independiente la persistencia de auditoría."},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"El chart puede habilitar instrumentación OpenTelemetry. Las trazas se exportan por OTLP HTTP y los logs pueden dirigirse a un endpoint compatible, como VictoriaLogs. Usa un identificador de correlación y la misma ventana temporal para unir Gateway, authz, servicio y dependencia."},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Antes de cerrar una incidencia, guarda:"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"causa confirmada;"},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"alcance temporal y recursos afectados;"},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"comandos o consultas utilizados;"},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"cambio aplicado y forma de revertirlo;"},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"validación desde un consumidor;"},"429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"acción preventiva y propietario."},"430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administración"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control"},"431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control","content":"Diseña quién puede acceder a Lamassu mediante principales, políticas, permisos sobre recursos y autorización de rutas HTTP."},"432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/administration/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-previe