ckstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Subject**: los datos de organización y país de tu evaluación."},"2233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: por ejemplo, un año desde la creación."},"2234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: por ejemplo, 90 días, dentro de la vigencia de la CA."},"2235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"El nombre de la CA se utilizará como `Common Name`. Mantén los usos de CA necesarios para firmar certificados y CRLs."},"2236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Comprueba motor, algoritmo, sujeto, tipo raíz y fechas. Confirma la creación y anota el identificador de la autoridad para reconocerla en el DMS o en la API."},"2237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Abre la nueva CA. Debe aparecer activa, mostrar su certificado y permitir acceder a **Issued Certificates**."},"2238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Descarga o copia el certificado PEM de la autoridad y guárdalo como `ca.pem`. Comprueba que el archivo contiene el bloque completo, incluidos `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` y `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Ejecuta desde el directorio donde guardaste `ca.pem`:"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Comprueba que sujeto y emisor corresponden a la raíz creada, las fechas incluyen el momento actual, **Basic Constraints** contiene `CA:TRUE` y **Key Usage** permite firmar certificados. El último comando debe devolver `ca.pem: OK`."},"2241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certificado-de-ca","content":"Has elegido explícitamente `ca.pem` como ancla de esta prueba. Que la autofirma sea válida no instala esa confianza en otros consumidores. Consulta la referencia de openssl-verify para las opciones de comprobación."},"2242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si la creación falla, comprueba permisos, disponibilidad del motor y algoritmo seleccionado."},"2243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si OpenSSL no lee el archivo, vuelve a copiar el bloque PEM completo."},"2244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si fallan la firma o las fechas, revisa que hayas descargado el certificado de esta CA y que el reloj del equipo sea correcto."},"2245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"El diagnóstico PKI reúne las comprobaciones de emisión y dependencias criptográficas."},"2246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Continúa con Emite y verifica un certificado, utilizando esta autoridad y `ca.pem`."},"2247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Emite y verifica un certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave."},"2249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/is