tent":"Inspecciona contenido y fechas"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"Verifica la cadena"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Comprueba que la clave corresponde"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el resultado falla"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emitirás un certificado final para `device-001` mediante el flujo de generación de clave y CSR en el navegador. Al terminar conservarás `device.crt`, `device.key` y el certificado público de la raíz emisora, `ca.pem`."},"2262":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz activa con clave de firma disponible y permisos para emitir. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"2263":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Su certificado público en `ca.pem`; este ejemplo utiliza la raíz creada en el recorrido anterior."},"2264":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x y un directorio de trabajo con acceso restringido."},"2265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador para el cliente: aquí usaremos `device-001`."},"2266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave del cliente se genera en el navegador y debes descargarla al finalizar. Si la pierdes, tendrás que generar una clave y emitir otro certificado. El inventario de certificados permite descargar el certificado público, pero no recuperar esta clave."},"2267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA del recorrido anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"2268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser** para seguir este ejemplo."},"2269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Si la clave debe generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino, utiliza **Upload Existing CSR**, descrito en la guía de autoridades."},"2270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce `device-001` como `Common Name`. Añade los datos de sujeto requeridos por tu política y SANs si el consumidor los utiliza para identificar al cliente."},"2271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Si vas a continuar con el registro manual, el `Device ID` será exactamente `device-001`."},"2272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige un algoritmo y tamaño admitidos por el perfil; por ejemplo, ECDSA P-256 si está permitido. Para este certificado de cliente, selecciona **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication** y emite como certificado final."},"2273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Solicita, por ejemplo, 30 días de validez, siempre dentro de la vigencia de la CA. Revisa el perfil de emisión si el contenido resultante difiere de lo solicitado."},"2274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión. Guarda el certificado PEM como `device.crt` y la clave privada como `device.key` en el directorio preparado."},"2275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Comprueba en **Issued Certificates** que el certificado aparece activo. Anota su número de serie y verifica el material descargado con las comprobaciones siguientes."},"2276":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspecciona-contenido-y-fechas","content":"Comprueba `CN=device-001`, el emisor esperado, fechas vigentes, **Digital Signature** y el uso extendido **TLS Web Client Authentication**. Debe ser un certificado final: no debe declarar `CA:TRUE` ni habilitar **Certificate Sign**. Si **Basic Constraints** está presente, debe indicar `CA:FALSE`. Si solicitaste SANs, revisa que los identificadores esperados aparezcan en el certificado."},"2277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El resultado esperado es `device.crt: OK`. Esta comprobación utiliza tu raíz explícita y evalúa la cadena, las fechas y la compatibilidad con el propósito de cliente TLS. La presencia de los usos y nombres esperados se comprueba también mediante la inspección anterior."},"2278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"Si utilizas una CA intermedia, la raíz confiable debe estar en `ca.pem` y debes aportar las intermedias mediante `-untrusted intermediates.pem`. Esta variante se desarrolla en el modelo de confianza."},"2279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El comando no consulta OCSP ni CRL. Para comprobar revocación, continúa con Validación de certificados. Consulta la referencia de openssl-verify para sus opciones."},"2280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"En Bash, compara los dos resúmenes de clave pública:"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Ambos comandos deben terminar correctamente y mostrar el mismo resumen SHA-256. Si difieren, la clave privada no corresponde al certificado seleccionado. Vuelve a localizar la pareja correcta antes de instalarla."},"2282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Las opciones utilizadas se recogen en openssl-x509 y openssl-pkey."},"2283":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Resultado"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Qué revisar"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"La CA rechaza la emisión"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Permisos, estado y clave de la CA, algoritmo y perfil."},"2287":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Sujeto o usos diferentes"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Perfil aplicado y valores solicitados."},"2289":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"No se encuentra el emisor"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"CA descargada y cadena intermedia necesaria."},"2291":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Falla la vigencia"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Fechas del certificado y de la CA, y reloj del equipo."},"2293":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Los resúmenes de clave difieren"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Archivos de certificado y clave de la misma emisión."},"2295":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Consulta Diagnóstico PKI si necesitas acotar un fallo de emisión."},"2296":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Has completado el recorrido PKI cuando el certificado verifica y su clave corresponde. Elige cómo utilizarlo:"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Gestionar certificados para inspección, estado y revocación."},"2298":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registrar un dispositivo manualmente para asociar esta identidad al inventario de Lamassu."},"2299":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Preparar EST para que el dispositivo solicite sus siguientes identidades."},"2300":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"La aceptación en un consumidor requiere configurar su confianza, su comprobación de revocación y los permisos concedidos a la identidad."},"2301":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-38/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Prim